{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Bosonic Benchmark: `R` vs `CanonicalizeToR`\n\nCompares recursive old-style `R` evaluation with `CanonicalizeToR`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Needs[\"StringCode`\"];\nStringCode`InitStringCode[<|\"theory\" -> \"Bosonic\", \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\", \"conventions\" -> \"Bosonic-Xi\", \"bracket\" -> \"Flat\"|>];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1771044905069,
     "endTime": 1771044905317
    },
    "executionOrder": 1,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "newFast[args___] := Private`CanonicalizeToR[Private`U[args]];\n\nmakeBosonicInput[n_Integer?Positive] := Module[{z, w, u},\n  z = Array[Symbol[\"z\" <> ToString[#]] &, n];\n  w = Array[Symbol[\"w\" <> ToString[#]] &, n];\n  u = Array[Symbol[\"u\" <> ToString[#]] &, n];\n  Reverse@Join[\n    Table[b[0, z[[i]]], {i, n}],\n    Table[c[0, w[[i]]], {i, n}],\n    Table[dX[mu, 0, u[[i]]], {i, n}]\n  ]\n];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1771044905318,
     "endTime": 1771044905447
    },
    "executionOrder": 3,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Correctness Checks",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "correctnessCases = {\n  {b[0, z], c[0, w]},\n  {c[0, w], b[0, z], dX[mu, 0, u]},\n  {b[0, z] + c[0, z], c[1, w]},\n  {3 dX[mu, 0, z], b[0, w], c[1, u]},\n  makeBosonicInput[6],\n  makeBosonicInput[10]\n};\n\ncaseResults = Map[Check[Simplify[R @@ # - newFast @@ #] === 0, False] &, correctnessCases];\nPrint[\"Bosonic correctness per case: \", caseResults];\nallCorrect = And @@ caseResults;\nPrint[\"Bosonic all-cases correctness: \", If[allCorrect, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\nallCorrect",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<pre>Bosonic correctness per case: {True, True, True, True, True, True}\n</pre>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "\"Bosonic correctness per case: {True, True, True, True, True, True}\\n\"",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c6fffd23-661f-492e-bca3-ea36cd4e26d3",
     "metadata": {
